---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="This page explains what information may be collected when you visit the site and how it is used." path="/privacy/">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 5, 2026</p>
    <p>Something for Little Ones is a small website offering free printable coloring pages, activities, and other resources.</p>
    <p>This page explains what information may be collected when you visit the site and how it is used.</p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>You can browse and download our printables without creating an account or providing personal information.</p>
    <p>If you contact us by email, we receive the information you choose to include in your message and use it to respond to you.</p>
    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>We may use analytics services such as Google Analytics to understand how people use the website, such as which pages are visited and which resources are downloaded.</p>
    <p>Analytics services may collect information such as your approximate location, device type, browser, and pages you visit. We use this information to understand site traffic and improve the website.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>The website may use cookies and similar technologies provided by third-party services.</p>
    <p>If advertising is added to the website in the future, this Privacy Policy will be updated to explain the advertising services and the information they may collect or use.</p>
    <h2>Pinterest</h2>
    <p>We may use Pinterest tools to understand traffic coming from Pinterest and to measure how our content performs on the platform.</p>
    <p>Pinterest may collect information about visits to this website in accordance with its own privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Third-party websites</h2>
    <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those websites.</p>
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated as Something for Little Ones grows or as new services are added to the website.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:</p>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
